# Database Configuration
# For local dev the app builds the connection from the DB_* vars above (local
# Postgres). To point at a shared DB, uncomment DATABASE_URL below and fill in
# host / user / password from your team's secret store — never commit the real
# credentials here. The example line is a placeholder, NOT a working URL. kindly change it as per your convenience.

# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://<user>:<password>@<host>:<port>/<db>


